# Explicit public-file allowlist. Keep task inputs, outputs and local evidence out.
*
!.gitignore
!.gitattributes
!README.md
!RUNBOOK.md
!REPOSITORIES.md
!COMMANDS.md
!ESSAY_PREP.md
!serve.mjs
!AGENTS.md
!VALIDATION.md
!LICENSE
!templates/
templates/*
!templates/WORKLOG.template.md
!skills/
skills/*
!skills/task-evidence-check/
skills/task-evidence-check/*
!skills/task-evidence-check/SKILL.md
!skills/task-evidence-check/references/
skills/task-evidence-check/references/*
